    <string name="faq_title">Troubleshooting &amp; FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq_body">• Nothing on the PC: check that the phone and PC are on the same network and that casting has started.\n\n• \"Cannot reach the phone\": turn on the phone\'s hotspot and connect the PC to it, then type the address shown in the Connect tab.\n\n• No sound: Android 10 or later, microphone permission granted, \"Internal sound\" option on. Some apps forbid capturing their sound.\n\n• Choppy picture: lower the resolution or bitrate, or choose Low latency mode.\n\n• Windows Firewall may ask for permission the first time you start the receiver: allow it for private networks.</string>
